\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"version_added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">V.1.93.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n\"<i>A powerful tool capable of controling the way of the moon\"</i>\n</p><p>The <b>Hallowing</b> is a red glowing staff with a spider and bat wings on it. It can be obtained by fusing a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Fence\" title=\"Broken Fence\">Broken Fence</a>,</b> a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Plastic_Spiders\" title=\"Plastic Spiders\">Plastic Spider</a></b> (Unboxed) and a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Catseye\" title=\"Catseye\">Catseye Ore</a></b> (Raw ore) in unknown structure below <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a></b> during <b><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">a blood moon</a></b>.\n</p><p>It is can be used to summon <b><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">The Blood Moon</a></b> <b>at nights (18:00-5:00).</b> After each use, it has a reload time <b>1 hour.</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h3>\n<p>In the description Controlling is misspelt as \"Controling\"\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903034908\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.0